   NASHAT TV — کوردیی ناوەندی (Kurdish Sorani)
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

   Complete. The previous build was missing 52 keys here, including every
   string on the Live TV screen — the app's own launcher screen — so a
   Kurdish user's first impression of the app was in English.

   Terminology is fixed and consistent throughout:
     کەناڵ       channel        فیلم        film
     زنجیرە      series         ڕاستەوخۆ    live
     دڵخواز      favourite      لیستی بینین  watchlist
     گەڕان       search         ڕێکخستن     settings

   Sorani is written right-to-left in the Arabic script; layouts mirror
   automatically through android:supportsRtl and start/end attributes.
-->
